class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"762abc58e37c6f85\" href=\"?note=762abc58e37c6f85\" title=\"92-df-local-reflection\">92-df-local-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"57ea3ea286817df3\" href=\"?note=57ea3ea286817df3\" title=\"92-thm-second-incompleteness\">92-thm-second-incompleteness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\)</span> (local reflection schema, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"1ea2ee34667cb5dd\" href=\"?note=1ea2ee34667cb5dd\" title=\"92-df-reflection-principle\">92-df-reflection-principle</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rfn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{rfn}_G\\)</span> (local-reflection constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"762abc58e37c6f85\" href=\"?note=762abc58e37c6f85\" title=\"92-df-local-reflection\">92-df-local-reflection</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic soundness, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\n\\in\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\n\\land\nG\\nvdash\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\n\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\n\\in\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\n\\land\nG\\nvdash\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\n\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>这里“undecidable”明确表示存在一个反射实例及其否定都不可证；只证明正实例不可证还不足以使用这个词</li>\n<li>反射模式是句子集合，不能把整个集合当作一个对象语言句子写成<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\nvdash\\mathrm{RFN}\">\\(G\\nvdash\\mathrm{RFN}\\)</span></li>\n<li>由Löb定理：若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\">\\(G\\vdash\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>取<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\bot_G\">\\(\\varphi=\\bot_G\\)</span>时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\bot_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\bot_G)\\)</span>与内部一致性句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>可证等价；第二不完备性排除正实例，而可靠性又因该实例在标准模型中为真而排除其否定</li>\n<li>反射原理与一致性陈述的关系</li>\n<li>添加反射原理可以增强系统的证明能力</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"1ea2ee34667cb5dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"fd30fbde88ab93eb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-lob-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]